Figure 1:Task Definition of MMLVE. The core task entails three key constraints:
(1)CSEC: Cross-Shot Editing Consistency, preserving entity attributes across transitions;
(2)MID: Multi-Instruction Decoupling, ensuring independent execution of diverse commands;
and (3)ZDSS: Zero-Destruction on Spatiotemporal Structure, maintaining non-edited backgrounds and temporal continuity.
